://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background." width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c></h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We have over 9,000 ParcelShops across the UK, and we&#39;re proud to say that 96% of the UK urban population live within just one mile of a store. This doesn&#39;t mean we&#39;ve stopped expanding to meet the growing demand for our send, collect and return services!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you&#39;re a store owner who&#39;d like to become an Evri ParcelShop for your local area, <!--]--><!--]--><a href="mailto:parcelshop.networkdev@evri.com?subject=I%27d%20like%20to%20apply%20to%20become%20an%20Evri%20ParcelShop&amp;body=Full%20Name:%20%0A%0AAddress:%20%0A%0APostcode:%20%0A%0AEmail%20Address:%20%0A%0AContact%20Number:%20%0A%0AOpening%20Times:%20%0A%0ADo%20you%20have%20safe%20and%20secure%20storage%20options%20available%20out%20of%20reach%20from%20customers%20i.e.%20storeroom,%20behind%20the%20counter?%0AY/N%0A%0AIs%20parking%20available%20on%20site?%20%0AY/N%0A%0ANature%20of%20your%20business?%20%0A%0APlease%20attach%20photos%20of%20your%20premises%20%0A%0AYour%20message" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->get in touch<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> today. You&#39;ll find everything you need to know about what it takes to become a ParcelShop below, as well as details on how to apply.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="2" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="what-we-look-for-in-a-parcelshop" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>What we look for in a ParcelShop</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-5d43a0fc>Local, flexible and always welcoming, our ParcelShops are a convenient way for people to send, collect and return parcels. But before you send your details, please check our criteria to make sure your store is suitable.

To become a Evri ParcelShop, your store should:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/3736a9dc-2f90-4270-886c-46497bea535b_neighbour.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="default" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Be at least 0.5 miles away from an existing ParcelShop. Please use our <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/find-a-parcelshop" rel="noreferrer"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShop Finder<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->to check<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/7a1ec322-8d40-455a-811e-22d0ff0bf396_perishable.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="default" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Not operate as a food outlet (for example, a café, butchers or restaurant / takeaway)<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/41cd86aa-f6de-4624-bc9c-90ec921f0ed2_courier2.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="default" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Not offer another parcel service<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="3" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="list_block" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><!----><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-5d43a0fc>There are a few other things that will help you with your application too. We&#39;ll take your location and the population of your local area into consideration. If you have any questions before applying, or would like more information, please get in touch. We also love stores which can offer the following:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/0b4ebd07-2b68-4949-b6d0-18745f26e60b_lorry.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="default" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Close to public transport</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/c5ae823a-e4a5-442a-8703-eb67d851f6a8_car+port.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="default" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Parking available nearby</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/87286da7-2c41-462a-9634-2e74f2bf04f4_parcelshop+-+search.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="default" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Easy to access</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-s e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05" style="" data-test-id="e-avatar" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-4b59c4a2><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/6fb8763e-f02b-40b7-8e67-a916528bac93_parcelshop.svg" class="e-avatar__image" alt="default" data-test-id="avatar-image" data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><!----></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Good in-store environment</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="4" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-90dc4169><div id="benefits-of-becoming-an-evri-parcelshop" class="photo-list__text-container" data-v-90dc4169><h2 class="photo-list__title" data-v-90dc4169>Benefits of becoming an Evri ParcelShop</h2><p class="photo-list__desc" data-v-90dc4169>Becoming a ParcelShop provides lots of advantages to you and your store:</p></div><!--[--><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_31116a83.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=462%2C0%2C5477%2C3642&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=462%2C0%2C5477%2C3642&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=462%2C0%2C5477%2C3642&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel." width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><!----> Additional footfall</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You’ll get additional footfall which helps to increase your sales<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194a3f4.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=30%2C0%2C4564%2C3035&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=30%2C0%2C4564%2C3035&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=30%2C0%2C4564%2C3035&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="ParcelShop store assistant is standing at the till and smiling, posing for the photo." width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><!----> Get paid</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You get paid for every parcel that goes through your ParcelShop<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="link-block__item" data-v-90dc4169 data-v-805cf62b><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer inside a ParcelShop store, handing multiple parcels to store assistant, ready to be collected by Evri" width="1000" height="665" class="link-block__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-805cf62b><div class="link-block__text-container" data-v-805cf62b><h3 class="link-block__card-title" data-v-805cf62b><!----> Part of the community</h3><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You’ll be at the heart of your community as a one-stop shop for your customers’ daily needs<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="5" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="apply-to-become-a-parcelshop" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>Apply to become a ParcelShop</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-5d43a0fc>To apply to become a ParcelShop, you&#39;ll need to contact our Network Development Team with your:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>1</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Full name</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>2</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Phone number</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>3</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Email address</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>4</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Store name</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>5</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Store opening hours</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>6</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Store full address</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>7</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><h2 class="link-block__title--pb-0 link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-9bfd18e9>Any additional information</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--v-if--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="card-slice" class="section-wrapper" index="6" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2942bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2942.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2942.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2942.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer is walking away from a ParcelShop, holding their collected parcel in one hand and a store-bought cup of coffee in the other hand." width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c></h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Double check your contact details, store location and opening times are correct.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We&#39;ll check the information you&#39;ve provided then let you know if we believe your shop is suitable.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Once accepted, we&#39;ll ask your local account manager to contact you to arrange a visit to your store at a time that is convenient for you.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->They&#39;ll confirm that your store is suitable, run you through the basics and discuss next steps with you.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="7" data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-85d73ac7><div data-v-85d73ac7 data-v-5d43a0fc><div id="get-started-as-a-new-parcelshop" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-5d43a0fc><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-5d43a0fc>Get started as a new ParcelShop</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-5d43a0fc>On average, it takes most stores 3 to 4 weeks to begin operating as a ParcelShop. During this time, we&#39;ll make sure everything is set up correctly.

We&#39;ll order a printer and handheld terminal for you and arrange for them to be delivered. You&#39;ll just need to make space for your printer and ensure your shop has a space to safely store and organise parcels. 

Your Evri representative will then arrange a suitable day for the printer to be installed. On this day, the following process will take place:</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>1</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your Evri representative will visit your store to install your printer and set up your handheld terminal<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>2</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You (and any staff members) will receive training on ParcelShop processes<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>3</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Store owners and staff will sign a declaration which is securely stored on our system<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>4</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your store will then be able to accept parcels for drop off the following day<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-5d43a0fc data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__item" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-9bfd18e9><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-9bfd18e9 data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>5</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-9bfd18e9><!----><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-9bfd18e9><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Your store will also become visible on our ParcelShop Finder overnight, and available to receive parcels from hundreds of retailers the next day<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="become-an-evri-locker-host" data-slice="FeatureBanner" class="feature-banner feature-banner--pt-0" index="8" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__container" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__content" data-v-054940bd><!----><h2 class="feature-banner__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-054940bd>Become an Evri Locker host</h2><div class="feature-banner__text" data-v-054940bd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Looking to host an Evri Locker instead? Hosting an Evri Locker is an easy and hassle free way of generating income for your business. If you&#39;re interested in maximising your on-site space and would like to host an Evri Locker for your local area find out more on our Become an Evri Locker page.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link feature-banner__button" data-gtm-track="button-Host an Evri Locker" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/host-a-locker" data-v-054940bd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Host an Evri Locker<!--]--></span></a></div><div class="feature-banner__image" data-v-054940bd><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033aebd.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out" width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-054940bd></div><!----></div></section><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></main></div></div><div id="teleports"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{ENV_NAME:"prod",PUBLIC_PATH: