"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":151,"content":152,"icon":153},"Parking available nearby",[],{"dimensions":154,"alt":29,"copyright":29,"url":155,"id":156,"edit":157},{"width":111,"height":111},"become-a-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fc5ae823a-e4a5-442a-8703-eb67d851f6a8_car+port.svg","YeWDKxEAACAAmrUc",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":159,"content":160,"icon":161},"Easy to access",[],{"dimensions":162,"alt":29,"copyright":29,"url":163,"id":164,"edit":165},{"width":111,"height":111},"become-a-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F87286da7-2c41-462a-9634-2e74f2bf04f4_parcelshop+-+search.svg","Yh96FhIAAC8A-Zr_",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"title":167,"content":168,"icon":169},"Good in-store environment",[],{"dimensions":170,"alt":29,"copyright":29,"url":171,"id":172,"edit":173},{"width":111,"height":111},"become-a-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F6fb8763e-f02b-40b7-8e67-a916528bac93_parcelshop.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsl",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},{"theme":29,"title":29,"description":175},"There are a few other things that will help you with your application too. We'll take your location and the population of your local area into consideration. If you have any questions before applying, or would like more information, please get in touch. We also love stores which can offer the following:","list_block$94a51ed4-f7f9-4298-9e85-a70362f9811f",{"variation":178,"version":25,"items":179,"primary":218,"id":221,"slice_type":139,"slice_label":29},"photoListComponent",[180,193,206],{"title":181,"content":182,"isNumbered":20,"image":186},"Additional footfall",[183],{"type":33,"text":184,"spans":185},"You’ll get additional footfall which helps to increase your sales",[],{"dimensions":187,"alt":188,"copyright":29,"url":189,"id":190,"edit":191},{"width":64,"height":65},"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","become-a-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=462%2C0%2C5477%2C3642&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":192,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":71},462,{"title":194,"content":195,"isNumbered":20,"image":199},"Get paid",[196],{"type":33,"text":197,"spans":198},"You get paid for every parcel that goes through your ParcelShop",[],{"dimensions":200,"alt":201,"copyright":29,"url":202,"id":203,"edit":204},{"width":64,"height":65},"ParcelShop store assistant is standing at the till and smiling, posing for the photo.","become-a-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=30%2C0%2C4564%2C3035&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB",{"x":205,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":71},30,{"title":207,"content":208,"isNumbered":20,"image":212},"Part of the community",[209],{"type":33,"text":210,"spans":211},"You’ll be at the heart of your community as a one-stop shop for your customers’ daily needs",[],{"dimensions":213,"alt":214,"copyright":29,"url":215,"id":216,"edit":217},{"width":64,"height":65},"Customer inside a ParcelShop store, handing multiple parcels to store assistant, ready to be collected by Evri","become-a-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf",{"x":51,"y":70,"zoom":52,"background":71},{"theme":29,"title":219,"description":220},"Benefits of becoming an Evri ParcelShop","Becoming a ParcelShop provides lots of advantages to you and your store:","list_block$13ef2b64-261e-4089-bfaa-8f376dcbdcad",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":223,"primary":260,"id":263,"slice_type":139,"slice_label":29},[224,230,235,240,245,250,255],{"title":225,"content":226,"isNumbered":227,"icon":228,"image":229},"Full name",[],true,{},{},{"title":231,"content":232,"isNumbered":227,"icon":233,"image":234},"Phone number",[],{},{},{"title":236,"content":237,"isNumbered":227,"icon":238,"image":239},"Email address",[],{},{},{"title":241,"content":242,"isNumbered":227,"icon":243,"image":244},"Store name",[],{},{},{"title":246,"content":247,"isNumbered":227,"icon":248,"image":249},"Store opening hours",[],{},{},{"title":251,"content":252,"isNumbered":227,"icon":253,"image":254},"Store full address",[],{},{},{"title":256,"content":257,"isNumbered":227,"icon":258,"image":259},"Any additional information",[],{},{},{"theme":29,"title":261,"description":262,"showPaddingTop":20},"Apply to become a ParcelShop","To apply to become a ParcelShop, you'll need to contact our Network Development Team with your:","list_block$cdbbc691-2585-4a90-bb9a-82fd721ee014",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":265,"primary":267,"id":288,"slice_type":93,"slice_label":29},[266],{},{"CardImage":268,"CardAvatar":72,"CardTitle":29,"CardText":274,"ButtonText":29,"ButtonUrl":287,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":269,"alt":270,"copyright":29,"url":271,"id":272,"edit":273},{"width":64,"height":65},"Customer is walking away from a ParcelShop, holding their collected parcel in one hand and a store-bought cup of coffee in the other hand.","become-a-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2942.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7",{"x":51,"y":70,"zoom":52,"background":71},[275,278,281,284],{"type":33,"text":276,"spans":277},"Double check your contact details, store location and opening times are correct.",[],{"type":33,"text":279,"spans":280},"We'll check the information you've provided then let you know if we believe your shop is suitable.",[],{"type":33,"text":282,"spans":283},"Once accepted, we'll ask your local account manager to contact you to arrange a visit to your store at a time that is convenient for you.",[],{"type":33,"text":285,"spans":286},"They'll confirm that your store is suitable, run you through the basics and discuss next steps with you.",[],{"link_type":42},"card$af280f66-5001-47bf-b610-aae99f0f9b0c",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":290,"primary":326,"id":329,"slice_type":139,"slice_label":29},[291,298,305,312,319],{"title":29,"content":292,"isNumbered":227,"icon":296,"image":297},[293],{"type":33,"text":294,"spans":295},"Your Evri representative will visit your store to install your printer and set up your handheld terminal",[],{},{},{"title":29,"content":299,"isNumbered":227,"icon":303,"image":304},[300],{"type":33,"text":301,"spans":302},"You (and any staff members) will receive training on ParcelShop processes",[],{},{},{"title":29,"content":306,"isNumbered":227,"icon":310,"image":311},[307],{"type":33,"text":308,"spans":309},"Store owners and staff will sign a declaration which is securely stored on our system",[],{},{},{"title":29,"content":313,"isNumbered":227,"icon":317,"image":318},[314],{"type":33,"text":315,"spans":316},"Your store will then be able to accept parcels for drop off the following day",[],{},{},{"title":29,"content":320,"isNumbered":227,"icon":324,"image":325},[321],{"type":33,"text":322,"spans":323},"Your store will also become visible on our ParcelShop Finder overnight, and available to receive parcels from hundreds of retailers the next day",[],{},{},{"theme":29,"title":327,"description":328,"showPaddingTop":20},"Get started as a new ParcelShop","On average, it takes most stores 3 to 4 weeks to begin operating as a ParcelShop. During this time, we'll make sure everything is set up correctly.\n\nWe'll order a printer and handheld terminal for you and arrange for them to be delivered. You'll just need to make space for your printer and ensure your shop has a space to safely store and organise parcels. \n\nYour Evri representative will then arrange a suitable day for the printer to be installed. On this day, the following process will take place:","list_block$403f8528-db5a-42f4-ab73-acb347913054",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":331,"primary":332,"id":349,"slice_type":350,"slice_label":29},[],{"title":333,"bodyText":334,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":227,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":227,"buttonText":338,"buttonLink":339,"image":342},"Become an Evri Locker host",[335],{"type":33,"text":336,"spans":337,"direction":80},"Looking to host an Evri Locker instead? Hosting an Evri Locker is an easy and hassle free way of generating income for your business. If you're interested in maximising your on-site space and would like to host an Evri Locker for your local area find out more on our Become an Evri Locker page.",[],"Host an Evri Locker",{"link_type":38,"key":340,"url":341},"5f5bcb00-6b03-408d-9066-b47ec3360b6b","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fhost-a-locker",{"dimensions":343,"alt":344,"copyright":29,"url":345,"id":346,"edit":347},{"width":64,"height":65},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","become-a-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C17%2C8164%2C5429&w=1000&h=665","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":51,"y":348,"zoom":52,"background":71},17,"feature_banner$8222e16d-9f5e-465c-a8d7-3918b2269aa5","feature_banner",[23,58,94,140,177,222,264,289,330],["Reactive",353],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":354,"$sclients":420,"$sglobal-basket-count":29},{"abtasty":355,"accessibe":358,"appPromoBanner":361,"autoDivertUpdates":364,"awin":367,"bulkInternational":370,"bulkSendEnabled":373,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":376,"enableBasketCount":379,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":382,"euCustomsDuty":385,"groovyAdvert":388,"newInternationalSendFlow":391,"newinternationalpages":398,"oohPreferenceFlag":402,"opentel":405,"premium":408,"savedCards":411,"smallParcelSize":414,"yourPricesDrawer":417},{"_createdAt":356,"_updatedAt":357,"enabled":227},"2025-